@startuml
title Security tests, from the code to the deployed platform

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 8
}

rectangle "**Code and dependencies**, in the pipeline\nSecrets scan · code analysis · dependency and image scan · infrastructure scan" as L1 #FFF8E1
rectangle "**One service**, in containers\nAuthorization suite · token tests · error answers leak nothing" as L2 #E3F2FD
rectangle "**The web gateway and the identity provider**, in containers\nSession and cookie tests · anti-forgery · response headers · realm tests" as L3 #E3F2FD
rectangle "**The deployed platform**, in test\nDynamic scan · isolation of pods and identities · abuse and input tests" as L4 #C8E6C9
rectangle "**After the end-to-end tests**, in integration\nLeak test on logs, traces and e-mails" as L5 #C8E6C9

L1 -down-> L2
L2 -down-> L3
L3 -down-> L4
L4 -down-> L5
@enduml
